  "details": "A lot of avatars don´t work any more on vr only.\n\nWe were a lot of people in different instances today and this was topic number one, people complaining about it.\n\nPeople on pc or pcvr seem to be fine, but people on vr only suddenly can´t see a lot of avatars any more, even if they are marked as quest&pc. Apparently they only see that robotic avi with an \"error\" on it. One friend couldn´t even open the \"show avatar details\" tab, it was greyed out for him, nor was able to copy the avis.",
